#X text 863 480 It was interesting to reduce the [random] creation argument down to 20 This produced low frequency beats between the oscillators.;
#X text 876 538 I connected the output of the sliders to their respective [random]s and then changed the sliders. That just made the [osc~]s drone at 40Hz as the [random]s would have just kept producing 0's. To get any kind of result from low random numbers in this case \, I would need to have the sliders set to at least 2 SEE THAT TO THE LEFT.;
